{"n":97,"verses":[{"v":1,"en":"Indeed, We sent the Qur'an down during the Night of Decree","bn":"আমি একে নাযিল করেছি শবে-কদরে।","w":[["إِنَّآ","Indeed, We","innā",5],["أَنزَلۡنَٰهُ","revealed it","anzalnāhu",60],["فِي","in","fī",3],["لَيۡلَةِ","(the) Night","laylati",940],["ٱلۡقَدۡرِ","(of) Power","l-qadri",1078]]},{"v":2,"en":"And what can make you know what is the Night of Decree","bn":"শবে-কদর সমন্ধে আপনি কি জানেন","w":[["وَمَآ","And what","wamā",2],["أَدۡرَىٰكَ","can make you know","adrāka",571],["مَا","what","mā",2],["لَيۡلَةُ","(the) Night","laylatu",940],["ٱلۡقَدۡرِ","(of) Power (is)","l-qadri",1078]]},{"v":3,"en":"The Night of Decree is better than a thousand months","bn":"শবে-কদর হল এক হাজার মাস অপেক্ষা শ্রেষ্ঠ।","w":[["لَيۡلَةُ","(The) Night","laylatu",940],["ٱلۡقَدۡرِ","(of) Power","l-qadri",1078],["خَيۡرࣱ","(is) better","khayrun",61],["مِّنۡ","than","min",0],["أَلۡفِ","a thousand","alfi",640],["شَهۡرٖ","month(s)","shahrin",478]]},{"v":4,"en":"The angels and the Spirit descend therein by permission of their Lord for every matter","bn":"এতে প্রত্যেক কাজের জন্যে ফেরেশতাগণ ও রূহ অবতীর্ণ হয় তাদের পালনকর্তার নির্দেশক্রমে।","w":[["تَنَزَّلُ","Descend","tanazzalu",1113],["ٱلۡمَلَـٰٓئِكَةُ","the Angels","l-malāikatu",122],["وَٱلرُّوحُ","and the Spirit","wal-rūḥu",477],["فِيهَا","therein","fīhā",3],["بِإِذۡنِ","by (the) permission","bi-idh'ni",291],["رَبِّهِم","(of) their Lord","rabbihim",12],["مِّن","for","min",0],["كُلِّ","every","kulli",30],["أَمۡرٖ","affair","amrin",67]]},{"v":5,"en":"Peace it is until the emergence of dawn","bn":"এটা নিরাপত্তা, যা ফজরের উদয় পর্যন্ত অব্যাহত থাকে।","w":[["سَلَٰمٌ","Peace","salāmun",270],["هِيَ","it (is)","hiya",58],["حَتَّىٰ","until","ḥattā",83],["مَطۡلَعِ","(the) emergence","maṭlaʿi",4733],["ٱلۡفَجۡرِ","(of) the dawn","l-fajri",1141]]}]}